WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.069
-Following Disney's recent
announcement of what critics

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.970
are calling
the "Don't Say Gay" bill,

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:06.706
which prohibits Florida
public school teachers

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:09.375
from instructing on sexual
orientation or gender identity

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:10.409
through third grade,

00:00:10.409 --> 00:00:12.278
many conservative Disney fans

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:14.013
have been voicing their opinion

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:16.015
that the park
has become too woke,

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:18.284
and even going as far as
accusing the company

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:20.153
of promoting
the sexual grooming of children.

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:23.089
Here to talk about it
are two adult Disney fans.

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:27.627
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:30.596
Uh, thank you so much
for being here.

00:00:30.596 --> 00:00:32.932
-We were already in the area,
visiting a Times Square Elsa.

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:34.133
-Okay, great.

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:36.503
So, a lot of conservative
Disney fans are upset

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:37.971
that the company is speaking out

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:41.141
against Florida's Parental
Rights in Education bill,

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:42.908
also known as
the "Don't Say Gay" bill.

00:00:42.908 --> 00:00:43.876
How do you feel about it?

00:00:43.876 --> 00:00:45.878
-Seth, it is a tragedy.

00:00:45.878 --> 00:00:49.049
Disney is trying to
indoctrinate our children.

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.749
-Okay, and how old
are your children?

00:00:50.749 --> 00:00:53.419
-Oh, we don't have any.
-Okay.

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:54.954
-But it doesn't change the fact

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:57.290
that we go to Disney
for the character breakfasts,

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.793
not the sexualization of minors.

00:00:59.793 --> 00:01:01.460
-Okay, and are you referring to
the fact

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:04.196
that the Little Mermaid
gets married at 16?

00:01:04.196 --> 00:01:05.297
-No, that's okay.

00:01:05.297 --> 00:01:07.967
-Oh, and Princess Jasmine
was 15?

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:10.136
-That's okay.
-And Snow White was 14?

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:11.470
-The boy-girl ones are fine!

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:13.673
-Okay, so that...

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:15.741
that feels a little telling.

00:01:15.741 --> 00:01:18.711
-All we're saying is
that the intolerant left

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:20.813
is ruining the magic of Disney

00:01:20.813 --> 00:01:23.816
for God-fearing,
Splash-Mountain-riding

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:26.953
conservatives like us.
-Yeah, but how?

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:29.189
-Take last week, for instance.
-Okay.

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:31.290
Rebecca and I were trying
to ride the Teacups,

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:33.159
and they were like, "Okay,
well, we need to put you

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:34.193
with a third rider."

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:37.096
Fine.
We're very agreeable people.

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:38.964
-Yeah, no, I think
we're all picking up on that.

00:01:38.964 --> 00:01:41.734
[ Laughter ]
-So we said, "No problem.

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:44.804
Can you just make sure they're
straight and unvaccinated?"

00:01:46.506 --> 00:01:49.408
And this socialist ride operator

00:01:49.408 --> 00:01:52.445
was like, "I'm sorry,
we can't do that."

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:55.381
-Well, I mean, it does seem
like an unreasonable request.

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:57.816
-Sorry I don't want
anything gay going on

00:01:57.816 --> 00:01:59.218
while I'm riding
a little teacup.

00:01:59.218 --> 00:02:00.720
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.655
-Okay, take the week before.

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:05.625
-You guys went to Disney World
two weeks in a row?

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:08.294
-Yes, we love it,
and we're very normal adults.

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:11.664
So Keith and I
are riding Space Mountain,

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:13.065
and who's sitting in front of us

00:02:13.065 --> 00:02:16.736
but a 40-year-old man
and a 10-year-old boy.

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:18.471
How sick is that?

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:22.442
-We were like, "You leave
Pinocchio alone, Gepetto-phile!"

00:02:22.442 --> 00:02:24.010
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:26.412
Made a really big scene.
It was really healthy.

00:02:26.412 --> 00:02:28.882
-And he was all,
"This is my son.

00:02:28.882 --> 00:02:30.716
We're on a family vacation."

00:02:30.716 --> 00:02:35.487
Yeah, a likely story.
-That's a very likely story.

00:02:35.487 --> 00:02:37.223
-And then when we got off,

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:39.158
the ride operator wouldn't
even say "Merry Christmas."

00:02:39.158 --> 00:02:43.263
-Well, it's April.
-My God, you're as bad as him.

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:45.264
-Okay, so three weeks earlier --

00:02:45.264 --> 00:02:48.034
-Oh, my God, how often can
one couple go to Disney World?

00:02:48.034 --> 00:02:50.269
-Oh, we're not a couple.
We're brother and sister.

00:02:50.269 --> 00:02:52.972
-Oh-yoy-yoy.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:56.409
-So we're riding
the Haunted Mansion.

00:02:56.409 --> 00:02:57.910
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:00.212
This is serious, Seth.
-Okay, fine.

00:03:00.212 --> 00:03:02.248
Your brother's
making a weird face.

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:03.917
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.484 --> 00:03:06.852
-Are you okay?
-I'll be fine.

00:03:06.852 --> 00:03:09.389
-Is he bothering you?
-Yes!

00:03:09.389 --> 00:03:12.091
-Anyway, as I was saying...
-Okay. Uh-huh.

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:13.826
-...we're riding the Haunted
Mansion,

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:17.330
and they have this
bride and groom ghost.

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:18.664
-Okay.

00:03:18.664 --> 00:03:22.101
-That's the end of the story.
Don't you see, Seth?

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:24.704
They're teaching kids
if you're straight, you'll die.

00:03:24.704 --> 00:03:30.242
-I can't imagine that's the
message of the Haunted Mansion.

00:03:30.242 --> 00:03:33.412
-Seth, did you know

00:03:33.412 --> 00:03:35.982
they won't even let you
pull down Minnie's skirt anymore

00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:39.018
to see her mouse business?
-Why would you want to do that?

00:03:39.018 --> 00:03:42.322
-To make sure it's
not Mickey in a dress

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:43.990
trying to use
the women's bathroom.

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.658
-Okay, you know what?
I think we're done here.

00:03:45.658 --> 00:03:47.760
The problem is clearly you
and not Disney.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:49.128
-Yeah, well,
we got to go anyway.

00:03:49.128 --> 00:03:51.297
We're circulating a petition
to make sure Chip and Dale

00:03:51.297 --> 00:03:52.765
can't get within 20 feet
of a school.

00:03:52.765 --> 00:03:55.167
-Alright, two adult Disney fans,
everybody.

00:03:55.167 --> 00:03:56.569
[ Applause ]
-They're not churros,

00:03:56.569 --> 00:03:58.104
they're freedom sticks!

00:03:58.104 --> 00:04:01.140
-Make Marsha Blackburn
a Disney Princess, you cowards!

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:03.209
-We'll be right back
with more "Late Night"!

